<section class="cp-support-hero"><span class="cx-kicker">Customer care</span><h2>How can we help today?</h2><p>Ask about orders, vendor-managed delivery, returns, payments, events, or your account.</p></section>
<section class="cp-panel"><header class="cp-panel-head"><div><span class="cx-kicker">Your support requests</span><h2>Tickets</h2><p id="cs-status" role="status">Loading tickets…</p></div><button class="cc-btn primary" id="cs-new" type="button"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> New request</button></header><div class="cp-ticket-list" id="cs-tickets"></div></section>
<section class="cp-panel" id="cs-detail" hidden><header class="cp-panel-head"><div><span class="cx-kicker">Ticket conversation</span><h2 id="cs-detail-title"></h2></div><button class="cc-btn" id="cs-close-detail" type="button">Back to tickets</button></header><div id="cs-messages" class="cc-card-body"></div><form id="cs-reply" class="cc-card-body"><label for="cs-reply-text">Reply to support</label><textarea class="cc-textarea" id="cs-reply-text" minlength="10" maxlength="5000" required></textarea><div class="cc-form-actions"><button class="cc-btn primary" type="submit">Send reply</button></div></form></section>
<section class="cp-safety-card"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></span><div><h2>Shop and communicate safely</h2><p>Pay only through Conscious Indi checkout. Never share OTPs, card PINs or passwords. Delivery updates are entered manually by vendors.</p></div></section>
<dialog class="cc-dialog" id="cs-dialog"><div class="cc-dialog-head"><h2>Create a support request</h2><button class="cc-btn small" id="cs-close-dialog" type="button" aria-label="Close"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></div><form class="cc-card-body" id="cs-form"><div class="cc-form-grid"><div class="cc-field"><label for="cs-category">Topic</label><select class="cc-select" id="cs-category" required><option value="">Choose a topic</option><option value="order">Order or delivery</option><option value="return">Return or refund</option><option value="payment">Payment</option><option value="product">Product</option><option value="account">Account or privacy</option><option value="other">Event or other</option></select></div><div class="cc-field full"><label for="cs-subject">Subject</label><input class="cc-input" id="cs-subject" minlength="5" maxlength="180" required></div><div class="cc-field full"><label for="cs-message">Tell us what happened</label><textarea class="cc-textarea" id="cs-message" minlength="10" maxlength="5000" required></textarea></div></div><div class="cc-form-actions"><button class="cc-btn primary" type="submit">Submit request</button></div></form></dialog>
